{"4904380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Climb the Fools", "steam_appid": 4904380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultra-Hardcore Climbing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale the wall by mastering the controls for your right hand, left hand, right foot, and left foot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let go with both hands, and you'll plummet straight down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The slope is full of dangers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the stick to aim where you extend your limbs and carve out your own climbing route!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The slope is fraught with perils—from sudden gusts of wind to attacks by birds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I pray for your safety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make full use of relief supplies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're bound to find items somewhere that will help with your climb!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are even items that let you shoot down anything standing in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, it's a world of survival of the fittest!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultra-Hardcore Climbing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale the wall by mastering the controls for your right hand, left hand, right foot, and left foot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let go with both hands, and you'll plummet straight down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The slope is full of dangers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the stick to aim where you extend your limbs and carve out your own climbing route!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The slope is fraught with perils—from sudden gusts of wind to attacks by birds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I pray for your safety.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make full use of relief supplies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're bound to find items somew